  "title": "Fox Corporation Chief Financial Officer Steve Tomsic to Participate in Upcoming UBS Global Media and Communications Conference 2025",
  "summary": "New York, NY and Los Angeles, CA – December 1, 2025 – Fox Corporation (Nasdaq: FOXA, FOX) today announced that Chief Financial Officer Steve Tomsic will participate in the upcoming UBS Global Media and Communications Conference on Monday, December 8, at approximately 10:30am (Eastern), 7:30am (Pacific). A live and archived webcast of the presentation will […]",
